---
---

<section class="how-help section" id="how-help">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section__label gsap-fade-up">Our Services</span>
    <h2 class="section__title gsap-fade-up">
      How Can I <span class="text-gradient">Help You?</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="section__subtitle gsap-fade-up">
      Every journey is different. Here's how expert health coaches guide their 
      clients from struggle to success, backed by behavioral psychology and nutritional science.
    </p>

    <div class="how-help__grid gsap-stagger-parent">
      <div class="how-help__card gsap-stagger-child">
        <div class="how-help__card-header">
          <div class="how-help__card-icon">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
              <path d="M14 2v6h6"/>
              <path d="M16 13H8"/>
              <path d="M16 17H8"/>
              <path d="M10 9H8"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="how-help__card-tag">Core Service</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="how-help__card-title">Personalized Diet Planning</h3>
        <p class="how-help__card-text">
          A customized meal plan tailored to your body type, metabolic rate, food preferences, 
          and cultural eating habits. We calculate your exact caloric needs and create 
          macro-optimized plans that you'll actually enjoy following.
        </p>
        <ul class="how-help__card-features">
          <li>Calorie & macro calculation</li>
          <li>Meal timing optimization</li>
          <li>Vegetarian/Non-veg options</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="how-help__card gsap-stagger-child">
        <div class="how-help__card-header">
          <div class="how-help__card-icon">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
              <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
              <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="how-help__card-tag">Guidance</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="how-help__card-title">1-on-1 Lifestyle Coaching</h3>
        <p class="how-help__card-text">
          Behavioral psychology shows that accountability is the #1 predictor of success. 
          Through regular coaching sessions, we address stress eating, emotional triggers, 
          sleep patterns, and help you build sustainable habits through habit stacking.
        </p>
        <ul class="how-help__card-features">
          <li>Behavioral pattern analysis</li>
          <li>Stress & sleep management</li>
          <li>Habit stacking methodology</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="how-help__card gsap-stagger-child">
        <div class="how-help__card-header">
          <div class="how-help__card-icon">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="how-help__card-tag">Tracking</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="how-help__card-title">Progress Monitoring</h3>
        <p class="how-help__card-text">
          What gets measured gets managed. We track your weight, body measurements, 
          energy levels, and adherence weekly. Based on your progress data, plans are 
          dynamically adjusted to ensure you're always moving toward your goal.
        </p>
        <ul class="how-help__card-features">
          <li>Weekly body metrics tracking</li>
          <li>Dynamic plan adjustments</li>
          <li>Progress photo comparisons</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="how-help__card gsap-stagger-child">
        <div class="how-help__card-header">
          <div class="how-help__card-icon">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
              <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="how-help__card-tag">Support</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="how-help__card-title">Ongoing Accountability</h3>
        <p class="how-help__card-text">
          Research shows people are 65% more likely to achieve a goal with an accountability 
          partner. We provide daily check-ins via WhatsApp, weekly review calls, and are 
          always available to answer questions and keep you motivated.
        </p>
        <ul class="how-help__card-features">
          <li>Daily WhatsApp check-ins</li>
          <li>Weekly video consultations</li>
          <li>24/7 doubt resolution</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  .how-help {
    background: $color-bg-primary;
    position: relative;

    &__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: $space-8;

      @include respond-to('md') {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }

      @include respond-to('xl') {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: $space-6;
      }
    }

    &__card {
      @include card-base;
      padding: $space-8;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;

      &::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        height: 3px;
        background: $gradient-primary;
        transform: scaleX(0);
        transform-origin: left;
        transition: transform $transition-smooth;
      }

      &:hover::before {
        transform: scaleX(1);
      }

      &:hover {
        .how-help__card-icon {
          background: rgba($color-accent-emerald, 0.15);
          transform: scale(1.1);
        }
      }

      &-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: flex-start;
        margin-bottom: $space-6;
      }

      &-icon {
        @include flex-center;
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        background: rgba($color-accent-emerald, 0.08);
        border-radius: $radius-lg;
        color: $color-accent-emerald;
        transition: all $transition-smooth;
      }

      &-tag {
        font-size: $fs-xs;
        font-weight: $fw-medium;
        color: $color-accent-gold;
        background: rgba($color-accent-gold, 0.1);
        padding: $space-1 $space-3;
        border-radius: $radius-full;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: $ls-wide;
      }

      &-title {
        @include heading($fs-lg);
        margin-bottom: $space-3;
      }

      &-text {
        @include body-text($fs-sm);
        margin-bottom: $space-6;
        flex: 1;
      }

      &-features {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: $space-2;
        padding-top: $space-4;
        border-top: 1px solid $color-border;

        li {
          display: flex;
          align-items: center;
          gap: $space-2;
          font-size: $fs-sm;
          color: $color-text-secondary;

          &::before {
            content: '✓';
            color: $color-accent-emerald;
            font-weight: $fw-bold;
            font-size: $fs-xs;
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
</style>
